stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Loading: Open territory evidence
    Loading --> Ready: Valid evidence arrives for current filters
    Loading --> Error: Invalid evidence or request failure
    Error --> Loading: Refresh evidence or apply filters
    Ready --> Loading: Refresh evidence or apply filters
    Loading --> Loading: New filters invalidate prior request
    Loading --> Idle: Authorization fails and evidence clears
    Ready --> Idle: Clear session
    Loading --> Disposed: Close view
    Ready --> Disposed: Close view
    Error --> Disposed: Close view
    Disposed --> Disposed: Ignore late success or failure
    Loading --> Loading: Ignore stale success or failure
    %% never Display Current for an impossible date or contradictory status.
    %% never Let a stale or disposed response replace the current view.
